Senior...

284
00:19:12,910 --> 00:19:13,710
Wan'er !

285
00:19:17,310 --> 00:19:19,430
The 15th strike is right before him...

286
00:19:19,470 --> 00:19:20,910
Why did he stop !?

287
00:19:21,350 --> 00:19:23,710
He's just a step away from Ascendant.

288
00:19:23,670 --> 00:19:25,830
Is he going to sabotage himself now !?

289
00:19:26,670 --> 00:19:28,430
The path to Ascendant

290
00:19:28,470 --> 00:19:30,550
requires severing emotions and sentiments.

291
00:19:30,950 --> 00:19:32,550
This final drum strike

292
00:19:32,870 --> 00:19:35,280
is the law of the heavens cleansing his heart.

293
00:19:35,550 --> 00:19:36,750
If he strikes it,

294
00:19:37,170 --> 00:19:39,420
he will forget his feelings.

295
00:19:39,670 --> 00:19:41,110
If he stops...

296
00:19:41,790 --> 00:19:44,120
his Dao Heart will be trapped forever.

297
00:19:45,070 --> 00:19:46,750
Back then, to breakthrough,

298
00:19:46,910 --> 00:19:48,830
I severed all emotions and sentiments.

299
00:19:50,190 --> 00:19:50,990
Will he...

300
00:19:51,870 --> 00:19:54,230
dare to walk a different path ?

301
00:19:56,910 --> 00:19:58,390
Little guy...

302
00:19:59,870 --> 00:20:01,600
What will you choose ?

303
00:20:02,670 --> 00:20:04,510
Break free from wordly delusions,

304
00:20:05,190 --> 00:20:06,990
sever all attachments.

305
00:20:07,310 --> 00:20:09,910
Only then can you reach Ascendant.

306
00:20:14,910 --> 00:20:16,390
Ascendant...

307
00:20:16,510 --> 00:20:18,710
So this is what Ascendant is !

308
00:20:19,150 --> 00:20:21,510
The law of the heavens really is merciless !

309
00:20:22,470 --> 00:20:24,510
Abandoning all emotions and sentiments

310
00:20:24,630 --> 00:20:26,110
is a way to flee.

311
00:20:27,870 --> 00:20:29,510
To cultivate like this

312
00:20:29,990 --> 00:20:31,790
is not my, Wang Lin's, Dao.

313
00:20:32,350 --> 00:20:33,960
My Dao is...

314
00:20:35,110 --> 00:20:36,230
defying !

315
00:20:36,670 --> 00:20:38,510
Defying this law of the heavens !

316
00:20:39,070 --> 00:20:41,510
I can throw away the sadness in my heart,

317
00:20:41,910 --> 00:20:43,830
but this lingering determination within me

318
00:20:44,270 --> 00:20:46,400
is not something the law of the heavens

319
00:20:46,430 --> 00:20:48,310
can take away from me !

320
00:20:50,310 --> 00:20:52,230
Merciless law of the heavens,

321
00:20:52,870 --> 00:20:54,830
let me see how

322
00:20:54,830 --> 00:20:56,910
you will stop me from reaching Ascendant !

323
00:20:57,190 --> 00:20:59,710
How will you stop me from defying the heavens !?

324
00:21:04,880 --> 00:23:09,340
“Ascendant is a lonely road… For those without any lingering feelings or attachments, then aside from having enough celestial spiritual energy and their domain fusing into their body, stepping into the Ascendant stage is extremely easy! Because it is so simple, they won’t have much growth in their future cultivation because their heart never experienced this kind of struggle! “However, for some people, there are lingering feelings in their heart. For these kinds of people, their domain breakthrough is a test and at the same time torture…”
[...]
“For my Dao heart to be complete, I have to wipe all the sadness from my heart, but is doing so… really worth it…” Li Muwan’s figure appeared before his eyes, and scenes of her flowed across his eyes.

“If the price for reaching the Ascendant stage really is to wipe away all the sadness in my heart, to erase Wan’er’s figure, am I still cultivating the Dao… Is this really my Dao… Wan’er’s life and death and her eternal slumber, if I were to forget all of that, she will have become my cultivation furnace in a way…”

“Although as a man, I can’t be a saint, I always have a clear conscience. The heavens are ruthless, and if I were to be ruthless as well, how is that defying the heavens? I would be going along with the heavens!

“Throwing away my feelings is the same as those cultivators that left the Demon General competition. This is a form of escape, and it is not my Dao!”

“My Dao it to defy, to defy and walk against the heavens. That is my Dao! Ancient cultivators deceived the heavens to cultivate. I finally understand the meaning of the word ‘deceived.’ But were they really deceiving the heavens? They were clearly running away. Although they were not going with the flow of the heavens, the destination was the same!”

325
00:21:10,450 --> 00:21:16,340
I've been walking this path for endless years

326
00:21:12,750 --> 00:21:16,340
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

327
00:21:16,730 --> 00:21:21,940
Is it the compass of fate

328
00:21:18,570 --> 00:21:21,940
that wrote this outcome for us ?

329
00:21:21,850 --> 00:21:27,860
The heavens want to erase your existence,

330
00:21:27,730 --> 00:21:33,580
that's the obsession guiding me.

331
00:21:33,610 --> 00:21:39,180
Is this the path to uncover

332
00:21:35,490 --> 00:21:39,180
truths from falsehoods ?

333
00:21:39,210 --> 00:21:44,780
In a world of murk and shadow,

334
00:21:41,110 --> 00:21:44,780
only the flame of truth can light the way.

335
00:21:44,570 --> 00:21:50,500
Look at them all,

336
00:21:47,450 --> 00:21:50,500
being carried by the waves.

337
00:21:50,690 --> 00:21:55,140
Look at them all,

338
00:21:52,850 --> 00:21:55,140
being drowned.

339
00:21:54,970 --> 00:21:58,460
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

340
00:21:58,250 --> 00:22:01,540
I will let the world refine my soul.

341
00:22:01,420 --> 00:22:07,100
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

342
00:22:03,110 --> 00:22:07,100
I will fight.

343
00:22:06,850 --> 00:22:10,220
I'll break through the abyss of despair

344
00:22:09,970 --> 00:22:13,260
to finally learn who I really am.

345
00:22:13,010 --> 00:22:18,620
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

346
00:22:14,890 --> 00:22:18,620
I embrace this obsession.

347
00:22:18,370 --> 00:22:21,580
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

348
00:22:21,330 --> 00:22:24,380
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

349
00:22:24,130 --> 00:22:29,860
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

350
00:22:26,170 --> 00:22:29,860
I'll still fight.

351
00:22:29,810 --> 00:22:33,220
It's hard to avoid loneliness

352
00:22:32,970 --> 00:22:36,260
when you are above everyone else.

353
00:22:36,010 --> 00:22:41,940
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

354
00:22:38,330 --> 00:22:41,940
be afraid of a firefly ?
